
# type(scope): subject            ← imperative, lowercase, no period, ≤ 72 chars
#
# Why this change (not what — the diff shows that). Wrap at 72.
#
# Refs: SP<N>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#
# Types:  feat · fix · refactor · test  (scope REQUIRED)
#         docs · chore · ci · build · style · perf · revert  (scope optional)
# Scopes: ui · layout · i18n · content · pages · contact · motion · blog
#         config · ci · deps · docs   (source: scripts/scopes.cjs)
#
# Valid:   feat(ui): add Button component
#          chore: bump astro
# Invalid: feat: add button        (feat needs a scope)
#          feat(header): add nav   (header is not a scope; use layout)
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. An empty message aborts the commit.
